WEBVTT

00:20:53.316 --> 00:21:00.316
(Applause and cheers)

00:21:13.534 --> 00:21:16.329
Chris Anderson: Brian,
so you heard and saw

00:21:16.353 --> 00:21:19.331
an obvious desire
by this audience, this community,

00:21:19.355 --> 00:21:22.527
to help you on your way
and to do something on this issue.

00:21:22.551 --> 00:21:24.869
Other than writing a check,

00:21:24.893 --> 00:21:27.396
what could we do?

00:21:27.420 --> 00:21:29.671
BS: Well, there are
opportunities all around us.

00:21:29.695 --> 00:21:32.181
If you live in the state
of California, for example,